    "body": "Thank you for your report. This has already been addressed by #2605 which will come with the next release of starship.\r\n\r\nYou can manually fix the generated config by replacing the generated top-level section with this:\r\n```toml\r\nformat = '$all'\r\nscan_timeout = 30\r\ncommand_timeout = 500\r\nadd_newline = true\r\n```",
